    "chs:intent": "Backdrop for our own content. It should recede so the thing being sold or argued for reads first. Roads are achromatic and hierarchy comes from width; water and land carry the only two low-saturation hues; warm hues are reserved for the app's own marks. Unpaved and resource roads differ by dash pattern, not colour.",
